# This file records external code incorporated into this project.
# New, original code is CC0-1.0 and is not listed here.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  External sources incorporated into yarn-spinner-runner-ts. Language and
  behavior parity target: Yarn Spinner 3.2.x (algorithms and diagnostics
  mirrored; TypeScript reimplementation unless noted as a code borrow).
title: yarn-spinner-runner-ts external sources
references:
  - type: software
    title: YarnSpinner
    authors:
      - name: Yarn Spinner Pty. Ltd.
      - name: Secret Lab Pty. Ltd.
      - name: Yarn Spinner contributors
    version: main (commit ec1a680fae4c0fc8aae73b23c7b87f3e5f894100)
    date-released: "2026-09-02"
    license: MIT
    urls:
      - https://github.com/YarnSpinnerTool/YarnSpinner
    notes: >-
      src/compile/crc32.ts adapts YarnSpinner/CRC32.cs (standard CRC-32,
      little-endian hex formatting for implicit line IDs). Other compiler
      and runtime behavior is a parity-driven reimplementation of the
      documented upstream algorithms (string table, shadow-line validation,
      diagnostics registry), not a code borrow.
      Accessed 2026-09-02.
